WEBVTT

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.768
the safety of it,

00:00:30.792 --> 00:00:32.058
the power of it,

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.625
the radiance of it.

00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:39.351
And to me that memory
is very deep and personal.

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:44.792
And it is the memory of the quality
of his essential nature.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:48.351
What a lot of people
don't know about my father

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:50.726
is that he was also a philosopher.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:55.309
He had a very ever-evolving philosophy

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.851
that he lived,

00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:01.518
and it is that distinction --
that he lived his philosophy